// Optional module map for users who want to integrate sherpa-onnx via a
// raw .a / .dylib rather than the prebuilt xcframework.
//
// The xcframework already ships its own modulemap (module name
// `sherpa_onnx`). If you've dropped the xcframework at
// `Vendor/sherpa-onnx.xcframework/` and added it to the JarvisMac target,
// you can ignore this file.
//
// If you're linking the C library directly:
//   1. Put `c-api.h` and the static lib alongside it.
//   2. Uncomment the block below and set HEADER_SEARCH_PATHS in project.yml.
//
// module sherpa_onnx {
//     header "c-api.h"
//     link "sherpa-onnx-c-api"
//     export *
// }
